{{!--
  relationship.handlebars
  =======================
  Renders a single relationship section.

  Context: a Relationship object (iterated from datamodel.relationships)

  Available properties:
    id, name, description   – Identity
    parent                  – Reference to parent LogicalEntity (auto-resolved)
    parentCardinality       – e.g. "1..1", "0..N"
    child                   – Reference to child LogicalEntity (auto-resolved)
    childCardinality        – e.g. "0..N", "1..1"
    attributes[]            – Attribute pairs linking parent ↔ child
      .parent               – Parent entity attribute (resolved)
      .child                – Child entity attribute (resolved)
--}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>

{{#if description}}
> {{description}}

{{/if}}
| Role | Entity | Cardinality |
|:-----|:-------|:-----------:|
| **Parent** | [{{parent.name}}](#{{parent.id}}) | `{{parentCardinality}}` |
| **Child** | [{{child.name}}](#{{child.id}}) | `{{childCardinality}}` |

{{#each attributes}}
{{#if @first}}
| Parent | | Child |
|:-------|:-:|:------|
{{/if}}
| `{{parent.name}}` | ↔ | `{{child.name}}` |
{{/each}}

---

